# Gettysburg July 1 1863 (GETTY1.CIV) with the computer playing both sides (Parameters, Computer vs. Computer).
# A digest at the end of the battle and at the pauses after it.
# Written by tests/make_scripts.py.
#! seed 74704
#! cfg side=1

# Pauses that any key ends; a unit's command: rest; the combat menu: Light Skirmish;
# Pursue ? and Stack Units: No; the time limit: End Game & See Results.
rule 1 key space
rule 5 key space
rule 2:C key enter
rule 2:P key enter
rule 2:S key enter
rule 2:T key enter

# Main menu, Load File; GETTY1.CIV in the list.
play until 2:M
digest
key enter
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key right
prompt
key right
prompt
key right
prompt
key enter
play until 2:M
digest

# Parameters (three down from Fight, which the menu highlights after a load; its
# letter would choose Player), Computer vs. Computer, Esc: the battle starts at once.
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key down
prompt
key enter
play until 2:G
digest
text c
prompt
digest
key esc

# The time limit: End Game. The results, then a digest at each pause until the
# Hall of Fame asks for a name.
play until 2:T
digest
key enter
prompt
digest
key space
play until 4
text Tester
key enter
prompt
digest
key space

# The main menu: Quit, Yes, and a key for END's "Press any key to continue".
play until 2:M
digest
text q
prompt
digest
text y
repeat space
